diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 194ba38..f6ffe59 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,2 +1,12 @@
 # usdr-fpga
 FPGA for uSDR
+
+The PCIe receive path includes autonomous blind DC/IQ correction. Raw 12-bit
+moments feed a sequential integer solver every 2^20 complex samples; mean and
+matrix coefficients commit together, with clipping/conditioning rejection.
+Correction precedes the existing FIR/DMA path and needs no host solver. PHY RX
+bank 7 identifies itself as IQC1; subregister 1 controls enable/freeze/reset
+(bits 0/1/2). The matched library enables it after analog startup calibration.
+Manual bank-5 commits retain their legacy behavior and select manual mode.
+`tests/run_rx_tests.sh` includes solver, waveform, signed-offset and lifecycle
+regressions. Readback exposes correction epochs plus raw ADC power/peak/clips.
